      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen— One matter, if I may: might I trouble\r\nyou for the loan of your might?",
        "Jp" : "覚者様――\r\n一つ、そのお力をお借りできないでしょうか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 588709,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In truth, securing the supplies needed to sustain\r\nourselves here has proven most difficult— Aye...\r\nmight I trouble you to procure provisions for us,\r\nif it would not be too great a burden?",
        "Jp" : "実は、ここでの生活を維持するだけの\r\n物資の確保が難航しております\r\n――ええ、物資調達をお願いしたいのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 616837,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Though it be summed up as mere \"supply\r\nprocurement,\" the journey will be hazardous\r\nbeyond doubt — I shall introduce one well-suited\r\nto assisting you, Ser Arisen.",
        "Jp" : "物資調達と一言で言っても\r\n道中が危険なものになることは明白――\r\n覚者様のお手伝いに向きそうな方を\r\nご紹介いたします"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 682209,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Might I trouble you to safeguard the lives of\r\nthose who have sought refuge here?",
        "Jp" : "ここに避難してきた方々の暮らしを守るため\r\nどうかお願いいたします"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 682210,
      "MsgType" : 0,
